+
+## HTTP REST Endpoints
+
+### Universal Command Tunnel
+```bash
+# POST / — accepts any command as JSON
+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8375/ \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"command":"status"}'
